@ApiClinica_HostAddress = http://localhost:5070
@TOKEN = 

# Uso recomendado:
# As contas obrigatórias `admin` e `user` já são criadas automaticamente no startup.
# 1) Execute o bloco "LOGIN Admin" ou "LOGIN User" e copie o token retornado.
# 2) Cole o token no `@TOKEN = ` acima.
# 3) Execute as requisições autenticadas (criar paciente, médico, consulta).

### LOGIN Admin (copie token e cole em @TOKEN)
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "admin",
	"password": "admin123"
}

### LOGIN User (copie token para testar permissões de User)
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "user",
	"password": "user123"
}

### CRIAR PACIENTE (use token do Admin)
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"nome": "Paciente Teste",
	"email": "paciente.teste@example.com",
	"telefone": "11999990001",
	"dataNasc": "1990-01-01",
	"cpf": "11122233344"
}

### CRIAR MEDICO (use token do Admin)
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/medicos
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"nome": "Dr. Teste",
	"email": "dr.teste@example.com",
	"telefone": "11988880001",
	"crm": "CRM9999"
}

### CRIAR CONSULTA (use token do Admin)
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/consultas
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"pacienteId": 1,
	"medicoId": 1,
	"dataHoraConsulta": "2026-06-10T10:00:00"
}

### EXEMPLO: tentar PATCH/DELETE com token de `user` (deve retornar 403)
PATCH {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"telefone": "11900000222"
}

